WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.288
Let’s walk through Team Actions.

00:00:02.288 --> 00:00:04.987
Use the formal team artifact to anchor what was decided

00:00:04.987 --> 00:00:07.312
and your notes to explain how it happened.

00:00:07.312 --> 00:00:10.625
Compare the active move, lifecycle state, and rationale

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:13.150
without editing from the Notetaker surface.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.462
On this slide, read the team’s Strategic Orientation,

00:00:16.462 --> 00:00:19.962
actions, or proposals alongside your process notes.

00:00:19.962 --> 00:00:22.887
In practice, use the formal artifact to anchor what

00:00:22.887 --> 00:00:24.212
the team decided;

00:00:24.212 --> 00:00:26.650
use your notes to explain how and why it reached

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:27.738
that outcome.

00:00:28.235 --> 00:00:31.060
When you are ready, use Open Team Actions to

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.873
move to the live surface.

00:00:32.873 --> 00:00:35.585
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:35.585 --> 00:00:35.735
.
